From 5243b4222158e54536632944f48ef8d14e07c4a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:36:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Items with logic for WASM server mods (API block 13)

Capability player-items: read and set what players carry, hurt them, give
them effects; item-used (can take the click) and item-hit events; shared
item-types interface; armour and tools stay data (components). API level 12;
item-logic example with harness support.
